{"flurry|Also... I'd like to apologize to the reindeer. Personally.":["cd3b2f75",3.98],"flurry|Corporal, do you ever wonder if we're the bad guys?":["93d4fb98",2.57],"flurry|Does this mean we finally get dental?":["b76faf1b",1.9],"flurry|It's really dark though. I've stubbed my toe like four times.":["bc0341ad",3.22],"flurry|Okay! Okay! Don't snowball me! I'll talk!":["540568df",3.05],"flurry|Sir? Do we get overtime for Christmas Eve?":["33f8929c",2.21],"flurry|Somebody's stealing our stolen sacks!":["0b5a8fdb",1.82],"flurry|The King has a war camp up on Reindeer Ridge. His battle plans are in the lodge.":["c0ef330d",4.3],"holly|Again?! How many times has he done this?":["4f4e8fea",2.16],"holly|And if it all goes wrong?":["57c43641",1.15],"holly|Battle plans. Step one: steal Christmas. Step two: question mark. Step three: get on the Nice List.":["73a84c00",6.6],"holly|Can we do that again? Like, every single day?":["3a8f77cf",2.62],"holly|Candy Cane Lane. It's never been this dark. Not even in July.":["95329772",3.94],"holly|Careful, that one's getting suspicious!":["d68edf5e",1.92],"holly|Dasher looks so cold. Somebody give Dasher a scarf!":["01fbfd21",2.95],"holly|Did anyone else's ears just pop?":["14a0ae26",1.82],"holly|For Christmas! And for hot cocoa!":["ca0067f0",2.02],"holly|Freeze! Er, I mean, hide!":["255588fb",1.51],"holly|Got one! Oh my gosh, we got one!":["327bc2ed",1.92],"holly|Hang on, Rudolph! We're coming!":["a6e6b277",1.94],"holly|He's looking right at you! Get down!":["f7f27d7d",2.14],"holly|I named my snowballs. This one's Gerald.":["6c172773",2.4],"holly|I'm whispering. Why am I whispering? I'm on the radio.":["4398ab42",3.34],"holly|If we win, I'm getting the biggest hot cocoa in the Lane. With the little marshmallows.":["1ce73400",4.63],"holly|Is it normal that my hands are shaking? Asking for me.":["aeb724d6",3.12],"holly|It's falling! It's FALLING! We did it!":["3f2caf94",2.57],"holly|Look at that! Candy Cane Lane, glowing again!":["cc93c14d",2.74],"holly|More of them! Why is there always more of them?":["0881136c",2.5],"holly|Not the Lane! They have the best hot cocoa in the whole North Pole!":["18e730a8",3.43],"holly|One down! Hey buddy, you're okay!":["e6515590",1.78],"holly|Ooh, pretty! Next one!":["3bfe64c4",1.61],"holly|Ooh, this one's heavy. I bet it's a bike!":["110ba916",2.3],"holly|Phew. That was close. Nobody else noticed.":["5c34aab3",2.74],"holly|Rudolph! Oh, it's Dasher. Hi Dasher!":["4d985fa2",2.62],"holly|Rudolph's nose is still glowing. Hang on, buddy. I'm coming!":["df56511b",3.6],"holly|Santa! Santa! The stables! They took Rudolph! And Dasher! And... the other one!":["57abc495",6.07],"holly|Sergeant, are you crying?":["de3778da",1.37],"holly|Sergeant, what's your favorite Christmas song?":["7437d7ed",2.28],"holly|Simple, he says.":["b09c9826",0.91],"holly|Small elves. Mighty snowballs.":["a3a6bae8",2.16],"holly|So do we sneak in quiet, or go in snowballs blazing?":["cce13564",3.17],"holly|The armory! Ooh, can I hold the sniper? I won't touch anything. Much.":["9882d2fc",4.61],"holly|There they are. Frozen solid, right out on the ice.":["ac6b5d1b",3.22],"holly|They're flying! Rudolph, you beautiful glowing goofball!":["aa4b306f",3.12],"holly|This is my first battle and I'm so excited and also extremely terrified!":["6ef4008d",4.46],"holly|This one's heavy. I bet it's a bike!":["08a76b76",2.02],"holly|This whole place is made of ice. How does he heat it? Does he heat it?":["00366562",4.08],"holly|We get to ride in the sleigh?!":["d9c0aa02",1.3],"holly|Wheee! Sorry. Professional wheee.":["d5091900",2.06],"holly|Wheeeeee!":["f9ebc86f",0.55],"holly|Why do bells confuse missiles?":["e453a633",1.61],"holly|You're like a ninja. A festive ninja!":["4a8a77d8",2.02],"jingle|...It's alright. I suppose.":["a52e9b1e",2.78],"jingle|...That's actually kind of sad.":["170a3d15",2.38],"jingle|And if they fire ice missiles, hit the Jingle Flare. Bells confuse them.":["3b82775a",4.78],"jingle|Bit loud back there. Effective. But loud.":["3c9f5068",3.34],"jingle|Blitzen. Nobody ever remembers Blitzen.":["b7bc8fc7",2.54],"jingle|Christmas Eve. Four hundred and twelve years I've worked this workshop.":["a3c01240",4.66],"jingle|Clean. Nobody saw a thing.":["bb937dec",1.7],"jingle|Crouch to stay small. If a guard sees you, the question mark fills up. Don't let it fill.":["24c30a85",5.83],"jingle|Easy. That lake is slicker than a polished candy cane.":["4416ef1f",3.07],"jingle|Elves! For Christmas!":["1e526e6a",1.18],"jingle|Good. Keep the pressure on.":["af89f1cd",1.56],"jingle|Got them. Now get back to Rudolph. Quietly, if you can.":["014ea461",3.72],"jingle|Grab and go. Don't stop to read the tags.":["550669ba",2.88],"jingle|Halfway there. Keep it steady.":["5810cf2e",2.21],"jingle|He's seen you. Three seconds before he sounds the alarm!":["d777d10d",3.5],"jingle|Here comes another wave!":["88186c2c",1.42],"jingle|I hate flying. I've always hated flying.":["eb73f4e7",2.98],"jingle|Ice cannons on the igloos down there. Knock them out!":["728e61fd",3.26],"jingle|It's a sock, Pip.":["686aef81",1.2],"jingle|It's the wind.":["ac6f3188",0.94],"jingle|Keep the Legion out of the circle or the power cuts out. Simple.":["8747eacc",4.42],"jingle|Landing in the courtyard. Everyone off.":["cb01a22e",2.57],"jingle|Mailroom. Want to snowball your friends? Send them a party code.":["abe64a4c",3.91],"jingle|Mind the mortars. When he shouts, move.":["e1d52a7d",2.54],"jingle|Never once had a quiet one.":["7b80e019",1.66],"jingle|Not bad, rookie. You only screamed twice.":["76667e32",2.93],"jingle|Not one alarm the whole way. I'm almost proud.":["a2565b72",3.22],"jingle|Patience. Let them walk past.":["77aec16f",1.8],"jingle|Patrol on the ice. Keep your head down.":["97d2d7e9",2.71],"jingle|Perfectly normal. Mine stopped shaking in 1712.":["e8d9a8b0",4.58],"jingle|Shoot the glowing cannons on its sides! That's how you bring it down!":["e2b2ac7f",3.67],"jingle|Silence. My favorite is silence.":["612cb2c2",2.09],"jingle|Small steps on the ice. You run, you slide. You slide, you fall. You fall, I laugh.":["39199a87",5.74],"jingle|Station by station. Clear it, hold it, light it.":["a22dd806",3.1],"jingle|That blaster's not suppressed! Everyone heard that!":["ee9b7083",3.1],"jingle|That's one. Keep moving.":["eaa3f1ac",2.06],"jingle|The Frost Legion war camp. A dozen guards, one lodge, one very important folder.":["403bb14e",5.86],"jingle|Then it gets loud. Loud is fine too. Just messier.":["527af54b",3.89],"jingle|Then talk.":["7d18d417",0.89],"jingle|Then we go get it.":["26d13de0",1.2],"jingle|Thirty-one. He sends a card every year. It just says: Soon.":["58464b38",4.37],"jingle|Watch the doorways. They love the doorways.":["14d0ce4d",2.95],"jingle|Well, so much for quiet. Go loud! Snowballs out!":["ba4f9607",3.22],"jingle|You heard the big man. Snowballs up!":["d4a3302b",2.57],"jingle|You've been spotted! Drop him, quick!":["749ac560",2.33],"jingle|Your call, rookie. Quiet keeps them guessing. Loud keeps it interesting.":["ef209538",4.54],"king|...Fine. Here. And... Merry Christmas. I suppose.":["090865bc",3.46],"king|...Free it. Quietly.":["417e9d4a",1.68],"king|...Really?":["1490c330",0.86],"king|A sleigh? You brought a sleigh to an AIR battle?":["98947930",3.14],"king|By sunrise, the children of the world will wake up to... nothing! Mwa ha ha!":["076b0888",5.81],"king|Do you know how hard it is to get a decent cup of cocoa in an ice castle?!":["cc348073",4.85],"king|Do you know what I got for Christmas in 1847? Coal. One lump. For one tiny avalanche!":["94ce480b",8.66],"king|Don't call me Gary!":["ad3d079a",1.44],"king|Every sack goes on the train. Every. Last. One.":["f80fa46e",3.72],"king|Gliders! Turn them into a fruitcake!":["c5ba41c6",2.45],"king|I can SEE you, elves! I have a very large window!":["a08971ab",3.96],"king|Impossible... beaten by... elves...":["a4390584",2.5],"king|Little sleigh... meet my FLAGSHIP! Mwa-ha-ha!":["40bd1c30",3.53],"king|Silence, Private Flurry! Villainy is its own reward!":["21a799d5",3.74],"king|So. You've come for the sack.":["a620dc11",1.92],"king|Tonight the North Pole freezes! Every toy! Every elf! Every festive little sweater!":["cae0a998",6.22],"pip|Each station powers about four thousand lights. Ooh, and the big tree!":["3d837da6",3.62],"pip|For the record, I designed the cup holders.":["4bb0d7b5",2.16],"pip|Fun fact: reindeer can see ultraviolet light. Not useful right now. Just fun.":["edb9c8d7",4.92],"pip|Honestly? Nobody knows.":["93589c78",1.39],"pip|I made you something! The Hush Mitten. It goes on the end of your blaster and makes it whisper.":["a56752c4",5.02],"pip|Ice missile incoming! Hit the Jingle Flare! Space, or cross on a controller!":["6e8f749c",4.22],"pip|It's a tactical sock.":["cbe0fe55",1.25],"pip|Pip from Toy Research here. If you break the conveyor belt, please don't. It took me ages.":["fd5a8a8a",4.9],"pip|Power's back on that block. Two more grids to go!":["4d5d6579",2.69],"pip|Pro tip: the Frost Legion hates snow down the collar. That's not really tactical. It's just true.":["77d59148",5.5],"pip|Settings! And cocoa. Mostly cocoa. The settings are in the cocoa. Not literally.":["30ac74bf",5.11],"pip|Sneak up behind one and melee to take him out quietly. The Hush Mitten keeps your shots whisper-quiet too!":["7ebfd6bb",5.86],"pip|The Polar Express runs on cocoa steam. Technically you could drink the exhaust. Please don't.":["1870688c",5.11],"pip|The candy cannon is on the back. It overheats, so give it a breather now and then.":["e371e786",4.03],"pip|The candy cannon overheats, so let it breathe between bursts!":["c225ee7f",2.98],"pip|The guards change shifts every... I don't actually know. I made that up to sound cool.":["336f4a69",4.78],"pip|Uh, guys? Bad news! The Legion is loading the gift sacks onto the Polar Express!":["d1a552f6",4.39],"pip|Um, hi! Pip here, from Toy Research. I've never been on a real mission radio before. This is so cool.":["c204e7bc",5.83],"pip|Um, lots of them are coming. Like, a LOT.":["d1b4abc5",2.4],"santa|...Then we're going to get him back.":["e9f0765f",1.97],"santa|...and to all a good night!":["63d58ef0",1.82],"santa|After Christmas, little one. First, we have a king to visit.":["d91c1724",4.01],"santa|Elves! Positions! Nobody touches the toy line!":["81e989b9",3.74],"santa|Elves, gather round. I won't sugar-coat it. Well, maybe a little. It is Christmas.":["00c40a6b",5.35],"santa|Four... five! Every sack accounted for. Well, nearly.":["c6ec8006",3.89],"santa|Gary, you buried a village.":["7031022e",1.97],"santa|Gary. Nobody is ever too far gone for the Nice List.":["88991583",3.55],"santa|Good work. And look at this page. He's powering his Citadel with the stolen lights of Candy Cane Lane.":["40d4b774",6.72],"santa|Ho ho HO! Did you see that zeppelin go down?":["214727c8",3.48],"santa|Ho ho HO! Did you see that?!":["cac610c6",2.3],"santa|Ho ho ho! Everyone gets dental!":["be15cf59",2.78],"santa|Ho ho ho! Look at them run! Back to the ice with you!":["d1eafe18",3.84],"santa|Ho ho ho! Merry Christmas to all...":["25ebcf45",2.74],"santa|Ho ho ho! Merry Christmas!":["c7d1a3a0",2.42],"santa|Ho ho! The map table. Pick a mission, any mission. Well, start with the first one.":["e559a353",5.59],"santa|Ho ho, nice throw! Very nice!":["7793a954",2.59],"santa|Hold on to your hats! Dasher, Dancer, full speed ahead!":["53084c27",3.89],"santa|Hold the workshop. Not one present leaves this building in a Frost Legion sack.":["bd63a395",5.52],"santa|It's in the Igloo Citadel, and he's filled the sky with ice gliders. We'll have to fly.":["3a572409",5.74],"santa|My own sack is missing. The big one. Every wish of every child is in that sack.":["3ecc4ddd",5.45],"santa|Not on my watch. Five sacks. Grab them all.":["a16c65e1",3.22],"santa|Off you go! Mind the snowballs.":["5dabdb87",2.5],"santa|Prancer, eyes on the sky, not on the cocoa!":["1122f7c5",3.41],"santa|Rudolph?!":["c4f11ea6",0.89],"santa|She's taking a beating! Keep those gliders off us!":["82678ecc",3.46],"santa|Stand next to each one and crack the ice. It takes a few seconds.":["d9ced6ad",4.37],"santa|Start by giving back the sack.":["5109011d",1.97],"santa|Stay out of their sight and they'll never know you were there. Get the plans, then get out.":["96933bda",5.18],"santa|Steady, elves. Steady.":["4674fab9",1.94],"santa|That's all five! Bring them to the sleigh!":["332b9e8c",2.71],"santa|The Frost King has declared war on Christmas. Again.":["5dc95d5b",3.98],"santa|Then bring them to my sleigh at the south end of the yard.":["38cfca48",3.62],"santa|This ends tonight. Up the stairs, onto the roof.":["cca1df36",3.34],"santa|Those sacks hold the presents for an entire continent. Treat them gently!":["ce4eb31d",4.85],"santa|Three light stations. Take each one back and hold it.":["f1500b0d",3.48],"santa|Up the stairs, onto the roof. I'll be right behind you!":["e0b9dfc4",3.82],"santa|Welcome to the workshop! Have a look around. Walk up to any station to get started.":["2fbbc504",5.5],"sleet|Corporal Sleet reporting. The lights are secure, Your Majesty.":["096b5764",5.23],"sleet|Every day, Flurry. Every single day.":["e4368d12",3.53],"sleet|Hold the stations! The King said no overtime pay if we lose!":["0fb80c28",4.9],"sleet|Sir, your cape is caught in the train door.":["5897668c",2.98],"jingle|Patrols on the ice. Stay low, stay quiet... and they'll never know you were here.":["bcd8278f",5.3],"holly|And if they do spot you? Make some noise. We'll come running!":["fbb65003",3.58],"holly|That's the alarm! Hang on, we're coming in!":["8497dddf",2.52],"cmd|Team Snowball. First squad to forty freezes wins. Move out!":["b4e34b6e",4.63],"cmd|Gift Grab. Freeze them, grab their gifts. Go!":["42b75588",3.94],"cmd|First frost!":["a06d3a4a",1.03],"cmd|Double kill!":["57a6290b",0.96],"cmd|Triple kill!":["02c1ee6a",0.94],"cmd|Snowstorm!":["3e7ef3ee",1.01],"cmd|Reindeer Recon is up.":["b8923461",1.68],"cmd|Snowman sentry deployed.":["270c9751",1.82],"cmd|Sleigh strike inbound!":["3d60a959",1.51],"cmd|Frosty drone away.":["d992cfca",1.51],"cmd|Blizzard incoming!":["34be0f68",1.27],"cmd|Peppermint mortars, inbound!":["a0e94f57",1.66],"cmd|Enemy blizzard! Brace yourselves!":["6b263d45",2.64],"cmd|Killstreak ready.":["d80a091e",1.25],"cmd|One minute remaining.":["dbb7ee59",1.37],"cmd|We've taken the lead.":["312d62d3",1.42],"cmd|We've lost the lead.":["f4aa3784",1.34],"cmd|Five more and we win it!":["3841aa0f",1.56],"cmd|They're five away. Dig in!":["c50e34ad",2.33],"cmd|Victory!":["9f8ad2ec",0.74],"cmd|Defeat.":["c6e4bb20",0.84],"cmd|Draw.":["52516bb7",0.67],"cmd|Final killcam.":["b3d3f3fa",1.3]}